          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Damanda jea ghwahina Orjeeda Siida aba jeeda giigheambiitaanyi, nea goodeana malaykajeega, hean gaygoopteada aba uhuuda hoorgeeda giigheambiitaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygabassa geat Eemoojiga sean madeadaanyi ak gaygooheeldooscheata gideajusu aheeldooscheata jeagiischoocheanda gisilga ea nooga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayghwayiin gisilga meatkweadaanyi bea geatinda dugwa ak ghwayiin nooga meatkweadaanyi bea geatinda ghaadaam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaygwayeesha sugoocheanda fugiga mida meatkweadaanyi bea geatinda dugwean, ‘Abeeni agoogeeda ghayi nigooneegwa Bwaabwa ghawooda ahearana sugoocheanduumeeda ghayi sibay eerarseegwa ghang'eada dea ghayi sibwada ng'eanyiida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba geabearjeewi jalooda ak googoonyean gichea daak, geabearjeewi muwooshta ak googoonyean beega jea dali, geabiisi dawoos rabascheanda ak gooluulean, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geabiisi dawoos dawiish ak gookwealean, ghaamnyaanyi ak ghoapkaanyi ooloong'sean, geandi ghealooniga ak ghoapkaanyi aloong'sean.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damani gaygwayeesha fugiga doobiiweadiin, ‘Ng'utamiida, nih gajea andamwani sidaayeay nea gibearjeewi jalooda ak geegoonyeey gichea aga, ghana bearjeewana muwooshta ak geegoonyeey beega jea leaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nih gajea ana eaweecha gil jea ea sidaayeay nea guwoosi rabascheanda ak geadeaptaaneey, ghana woosa dawiish ak geakwealeey? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gajea andamwani gil jea ea sidaahaneey nea gimnyaani, ghana midana ghealooniga ak geapkaanyi eeloong'seey?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Sugoocheanda nea gwayeesha, ‘Aba huumwa gaydayeeshiineegwa, gili wassean noosisi siyagi aba jeedeaba orjusu bea giyeanya manang'iin goosinnean aniini.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gaygwayeesha fugiga mida meatkweadaanyi bea geatinda ghaadaamiin, ‘Oang'amwana madeedeanyu, fuga ghayi simwaashta, aweayeena jeeda beasta manda muudeanooda ghayi sibay eerarsa meang'nyeandeenda ea malaykajeagaaschi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba geabearjeewi jalooda ak ea moogoonean gichea daak, geabearjeewi muwooshta ak ea moogoonean beega jea dali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geewooschi rabascheanda ak ea mooluulean, geewooschi dawiish ak ea mookwealean, ghaamnyaanyi nea geandi ghealooniga ak ea moapkaani ooloong'sean.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghwasha saawa nea gwayeesha, ‘Ng'utamiida, nih gajea ana eaweecha gil sidaahaneey nea gibearjeewi jalooda, ghana muwooshta ghana woosa rabascheanda ghana woosa dawiish, ghana miyaana ghana midana ghealooniga, ak ea meaweadeay?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwayeesha niny, gaydayeeshiineegwa, ‘Aba huumwa, ghayi iissa iyoaheawi asisiina ng'asheesu siyagi aba jeedeaba orjusu manang'iin, abeeda ghoaheawi asinnean aniini.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda fiisu gaygaweay jeeda ghoorjooda manda muudeanooda, nea fugiga doobiiweadiin gaygaweay jeeda eaweega manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
